        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R6310, Victorian 3 Inch x 10 Inch Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Victorian Floor Register is made out of brass and is available in 5 rich finishes. The ornate design makes it ideal for historic home remodels or if you want to add a touch of luxury to your traditional home. The 3 Inch x 10 Inch Victorian Register with Damper allows you to control the airflow into the room with the toggle. It is easy to install in an existing or new 3 inch x 10 inch floor opening.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-10-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6410\"<b>4 Inch x 10 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-12-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6412\"<b>4 Inch x 12 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-14-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6414\"<b>4 Inch x 14 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Victorian 3 Inch x 10 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued</b>.  See available <a href=\"/collections/vents-and-registers\"><b>Vents and Registers</b></a>\r\n<br><br><br>\r\n</p>",
