                "description": "The Victorian Floor Register is made out of brass and is available in 5 rich finishes. The ornate design makes it ideal for historic home remodels or if you want to add a touch of luxury to your traditional home. The 3 Inch x 10 Inch Victorian Register with Damper allows you to control the airflow into the room with the toggle. It is easy to install in an existing or new 3 inch x 10 inch floor opening.\r\n",
